# Project: Yumup - Meal Rating Flutter App
# Architecture: Clean Architecture + BLoC

## Tech Stack
- State Management: flutter_bloc (BLoC pattern)
- Backend: Supabase (Auth, DB, Storage, Realtime)
- Navigation: GoRouter ^14.x
- DI: GetIt + Injectable
- Local Storage: Hive + SharedPreferences

## Folder Structure - Every Feature Follows This Exactly:
features/
  feature_name/
    data/
      datasources/
        feature_remote_source.dart      # Supabase calls only here
      repositories/
        feature_repository_impl.dart    # implements domain interface
      models/
        feature_model.dart              # fromJson / toJson
    domain/
      repositories/
        feature_repository.dart         # abstract interface only
      entities/
        feature_entity.dart             # pure dart, no json
      usecases/
        get_feature_usecase.dart        # single responsibility
    presentation/
      bloc/
        feature_bloc.dart
        feature_event.dart
        feature_state.dart
      pages/
        feature_screen.dart
      widgets/
        widget_name.dart

## BLoC Rules
1. Events are immutable - always use Equatable
2. States are immutable - always use Equatable
3. BLoC never calls Supabase directly - only through UseCases
4. Every BLoC handles exactly 3 states: Loading / Success / Failure
5. Use Cubit only for simple UI state (no business logic)

## Clean Architecture Rules
1. Domain layer has ZERO dependencies on Flutter or Supabase
2. Entities are pure Dart classes - no fromJson/toJson
3. Models extend or map to Entities
4. UseCases have single method: call()
5. Repository interface in domain, implementation in data

## DI Rules (GetIt + Injectable)
1. Register all dependencies in core/di/service_locator.dart
2. Use @injectable on all classes
3. Use @lazySingleton for repositories and datasources
4. Use @injectable for usecases and blocs

## Coding Rules
1. Always use AppColors, AppTypography, AppSpacing - no hardcoded values
2. Always use AppStrings - no hardcoded text
3. Always use GoRouter - never Navigator.push directly
4. Always use AppButton, AppTextField, AppCard from shared/widgets
5. Supabase calls ONLY inside datasources files
6. Business logic ONLY inside usecases files

## File Path Rule
Before EVERY code block write the exact path:
// lib/features/auth/presentation/bloc/auth_bloc.dart

